<handout component="day21" xml:id="day-21-lecture">
  <title>Day 21</title>

  <introduction>

    <p>
        7.4 Regression Splines
    </p>
  </introduction>

  <objectives>
    <title>Covered in this class</title>

  <ul>
        <li>You should be able to articulate what the basis functions <m>b_i</m> are for cubic splines.</li>           
    
    <li><p>How do you define cubic splines mathematically?
        <ul>
          <li>You should be able to write down the equations for the model between knots.</li>
          <li>And the equations for constraints at the knots.</li>
        </ul>
        </p>
    </li>
    <li>How to calculate the cubic spline coefficients by hand by applying the above mathematical definitions?</li>
  </ul>

  </objectives>

